\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Co-folding pipeline overview. Phase\nobreakspace  {}0 identifies relevant cofactors and metals via AlphaFill. Phase\nobreakspace  {}1 maps catalytic residues through UniProt annotations and structural homology. Phase\nobreakspace  {}2 detects binding pockets using AlphaFill cofactor transplantation, Foldseek, pyKVFinder, and P2Rank. Phase\nobreakspace  {}3 predicts enzyme--substrate complexes with Boltz-2 using cofactor-guided, pocket-constrained, or unconstrained strategies. Phase\nobreakspace  {}4 scores each complex on iPTM, substrate burial, and pocket chemistry.}}{17}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cofold_pipeline}{{3}{17}{Co-folding pipeline overview. Phase~0 identifies relevant cofactors and metals via AlphaFill. Phase~1 maps catalytic residues through UniProt annotations and structural homology. Phase~2 detects binding pockets using AlphaFill cofactor transplantation, Foldseek, pyKVFinder, and P2Rank. Phase~3 predicts enzyme--substrate complexes with Boltz-2 using cofactor-guided, pocket-constrained, or unconstrained strategies. Phase~4 scores each complex on iPTM, substrate burial, and pocket chemistry}{figure.3}{}}
